      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Training_Instructor_TE",
      "text" : "You already know that you have to accept a mission in a certain period of time, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Training_Instructor_TE",
      "text" : "Moreover, you have to keep in mind that you can't accept both high-level and low-level missions simultaneously if they are of the same content."
